  "details": "There is a discrepancy between the start time of animation in a world and the time when players can view it.\n\nJoining a world with staging at world join.\n\n(For example, a view fade occurs when joining a world.)\n\nIt then joins the world with a few seconds of animation already elapsed.\n\nExample world:\n\nwrld_f0e32033-ed86-4564-a5a7-7cd8d5eecb2f\n\nThis world plays an animation with a visibility effect and a large title in the sky when you join.\n\nHowever, now the world joins with this animation already finished.\n\nYou can see me reproducing this issue in this video:\n\nhttps://twitter.com/PAZdayo/status/1783879720108724560",
